      "content": "the hotlines don't get it. they just tell me it'll get better or that people make mistakes. but this wasn't a mistake. it was me. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. it's like my whole essence is just... ruined. how can anyone ever look at me and not see what i did? there's no version of the future where i'm not just this walking, breathing error.",
